  "description": "It’s been six years since I became possessed by “Hellroad, the Evil God,” the final boss of a massive virtual reality game, and have been trapped in this world. The only way for me to escape is to be defeated as the boss. “Just kill me!” A low-level priest, decked out in various legendary items, appeared and subdued me. Then he said…\n\n *“I didn’t come here to kill you.”*\n\nHe claims he doesn’t want massive amounts of experience points or fame—there’s only one thing he desires.\n\n *“I want you to live. Don’t die, Iroha.”*\n\nTo me, who cannot escape this place unless I die, he whispered sweet words as he placed a collar around my neck to keep me alive. Will I ever be able to return to my original world?\n\n(Source: Piccoma, translated)",
